{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bd74dbeeffe386899b2cdd5af62bbd38.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spacefleet: Heat Death\u00a0</i></strong><i>is a <strong>realism-focused tactical space RPG </strong>that\u00a0combines <strong>fleet management, orbital maneuvering, station-building</strong>, and <strong>emergent faction warfare</strong> in the Earth-Luna system and its Lagrange points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your old life was never perfect. There was either too much or not enough. But in orbit, you can make a name for yourself. Trader, stationeer, mercenary captain, or fleet commander: become who you want to be in this sci-fi world. From scraping by on trade contracts and completing missions, you will slowly but surely work you way towards building an empire that will reach the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From humble beginnings, you\u2019ll rise (or burn) in a world where politics, physics, and invisible lasers collide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/5476de22a163d20278213d0ea1efef62.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from being a great word to describe the end of the universe, in this game, &quot;HEAT DEATH&quot; takes on a whole new meaning. Careful heat management and efficient use of power-hungry systems are vital to keeping your ship from melting and its crew from baking alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/a5adabd2fcfe3e2586c7071745870616.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in high-stakes battles with flip-and-burn maneuvers, railguns, and radiators. Every ship is composed of multiple modules with important functions. Lose your drive, and the ship becomes unmaneuverable. Lose your crew module, and the ship won't receive orders. Lose your radiators, and the ship burns from the inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/6db78777dac17a6673905dcfaaba5612.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the strategic map to command fleets, manage stations, and plan intercepts. Trade, smuggle, invest, gamble, or disrupt rival factions through logistics and force. HEAT DEATH's economy is based on supply and demand. Capture or destroy orbital farms and watch the system starve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/84bde531302256e2c837a498aca84914.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a single ship and a dream.  Rise through the ranks with diplomacy, subterfuge, and war. Complete contracts and earn valuable credits. Take on major factions such as the Shenzhen Interplanetary Corporation, Cascadia, and the Persian Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/d221055a8ff6b426db41b9a291307680.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish stations to serve as your base of operations, inventory, industry, and income. Upgrade defenses, lay down logistics, and carve out a piece of Earth orbit for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f30d1f878bd8a82d382daa6d64bfa989.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/1c1393ec53802d08e128d2fad64dd270.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Earth\u2019s ruined nations to orbital megacorps and ideologue enclaves, every faction has its own goals, strengths, and weaknesses. Form alliances... or shatter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/77bb36168a9f1ebbcabf5860c07b7910.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket science and orbital maneuvers don't have to be hard! Learn the basics in minutes, then dive deep into orbital tactics, heat sinks, and power distribution. We aim to make HEAT DEATH easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROOF-OF-CONCEPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacefleet: Heat Death</strong> is a proof-of-concept \u201clite\u201d version of a much larger game, <strong>Spacefleet:</strong><i>\u00a0</i><strong>Sol</strong>, which will span the entire solar system and have more core features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By buying <strong>Heat Death</strong>, you're supporting the development of <strong>Sol and</strong>\u00a0helping shape its foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo for <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>is also available. Once <strong>Sol</strong> releases, <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>will become <strong>free-to-play</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854580?t=1764867622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854580?t=1764867622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/6e856ad5d26e2dfa223bf6562c043c0bdb3f8d13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764867622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/6e856ad5d26e2dfa223bf6562c043c0bdb3f8d13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764867622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes stylized spaceship combat with explosions and destruction of ships and stations. There are no depictions of blood, gore, or dead bodies. The content is comparable to sci-fi space battles seen in general-audience media. There is no sexual content, drug/alcohol use, or other potentially sensitive themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bd74dbeeffe386899b2cdd5af62bbd38.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spacefleet: Heat Death\u00a0</i></strong><i>is a <strong>realism-focused tactical space RPG </strong>that\u00a0combines <strong>fleet management, orbital maneuvering, station-building</strong>, and <strong>emergent faction warfare</strong> in the Earth-Luna system and its Lagrange points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your old life was never perfect. There was either too much or not enough. But in orbit, you can make a name for yourself. Trader, stationeer, mercenary captain, or fleet commander: become who you want to be in this sci-fi world. From scraping by on trade contracts and completing missions, you will slowly but surely work you way towards building an empire that will reach the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From humble beginnings, you\u2019ll rise (or burn) in a world where politics, physics, and invisible lasers collide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/5476de22a163d20278213d0ea1efef62.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from being a great word to describe the end of the universe, in this game, &quot;HEAT DEATH&quot; takes on a whole new meaning. Careful heat management and efficient use of power-hungry systems are vital to keeping your ship from melting and its crew from baking alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/a5adabd2fcfe3e2586c7071745870616.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in high-stakes battles with flip-and-burn maneuvers, railguns, and radiators. Every ship is composed of multiple modules with important functions. Lose your drive, and the ship becomes unmaneuverable. Lose your crew module, and the ship won't receive orders. Lose your radiators, and the ship burns from the inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/6db78777dac17a6673905dcfaaba5612.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the strategic map to command fleets, manage stations, and plan intercepts. Trade, smuggle, invest, gamble, or disrupt rival factions through logistics and force. HEAT DEATH's economy is based on supply and demand. Capture or destroy orbital farms and watch the system starve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/84bde531302256e2c837a498aca84914.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a single ship and a dream.  Rise through the ranks with diplomacy, subterfuge, and war. Complete contracts and earn valuable credits. Take on major factions such as the Shenzhen Interplanetary Corporation, Cascadia, and the Persian Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/d221055a8ff6b426db41b9a291307680.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish stations to serve as your base of operations, inventory, industry, and income. Upgrade defenses, lay down logistics, and carve out a piece of Earth orbit for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f30d1f878bd8a82d382daa6d64bfa989.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/1c1393ec53802d08e128d2fad64dd270.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Earth\u2019s ruined nations to orbital megacorps and ideologue enclaves, every faction has its own goals, strengths, and weaknesses. Form alliances... or shatter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/77bb36168a9f1ebbcabf5860c07b7910.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.poster.avif?t=1764867622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.webm?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.mp4?t=1764867622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket science and orbital maneuvers don't have to be hard! Learn the basics in minutes, then dive deep into orbital tactics, heat sinks, and power distribution. We aim to make HEAT DEATH easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROOF-OF-CONCEPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacefleet: Heat Death</strong> is a proof-of-concept \u201clite\u201d version of a much larger game, <strong>Spacefleet:</strong><i>\u00a0</i><strong>Sol</strong>, which will span the entire solar system and have more core features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By buying <strong>Heat Death</strong>, you're supporting the development of <strong>Sol and</strong>\u00a0helping shape its foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo for <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>is also available. Once <strong>Sol</strong> releases, <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>will become <strong>free-to-play</strong>!</p>","developers":["Spacezero Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/7e5d3dc1873f87be27415e501dff128a97d15d91/header.jpg?t=1764867622","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 LTS, Steam OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Duo 2.0 GHz or AMD Athlon 64 X2 3600+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 6600GT / ATi Radeon 2400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard audio</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 LTS, Steam OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core CPU 3.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650-class (4 GB)<br></li><li><stron